V 32 32 32
-- Smooth laminar flow field (Poiseuille flow)
-- Color = velocity magnitude: blue=slow, cyan=medium, yellow=fast
-- Flow along Z axis, faster in center

-- Pipe walls (gray)
C 16 16 0 14 32 9
